<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador Nov consumer price inflation by sector.</title>
<headline>Ecuador Nov consumer price inflation by sector.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador's consumer price inflation by sector was as follows in November, the National Statistics and Census Institute said Monday:</p>
<p>    Food				     3.21 pct</p>
<p>    Clothing				 1.46 pct</p>
<p>    Housing				  1.33 pct</p>
<p>    Others				   1.42 pct</p>
<p>    Total				    2.22 pct</p>
<p>-- Gustavo Oviedo, Quito Newsroom, 5932 258433</p>
</text>
